mentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent19SignalBatchStrategyV","text":"SignalBatchStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Batched","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Deferred","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO8DeferredV","text":"Deferred","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Scs","text":"AsyncThrowingStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Success","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP","text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">>>, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Success","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The subject whose value flushes the batch."}]}],"name":"subject"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" over a stream of the subject’s one value, made afresh"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for each iteration."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The batched sequence listens to the subject without owning it: when the batched sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends or is cancelled, its wait ends at once and the subject stays pending for its other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"awaiters. A subject sent an error ends the batched sequence with that error, except"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"CancellationError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (as when another awaiter cancels the subject): then the signal stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"firing and the batches go on. A subject sent a value before iteration begins fires when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signal’s task starts, which may come after elements have arrived, so the first batch may be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"short. Each batched sequence iterated with this strategy listens anew, so a subject"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already sent a value fires again when a later batched sequence’s signal task starts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"code":["let shutdown = SingleValueSubject<Void>()","for try await messages in inbox.batch(strategy: .either(.count(50), .signal(shutdown))) {","    store(messages)","}","\/\/ Elsewhere: flush whatever is pending before shutting down.","try shutdown.send()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Flushes once, when the given subject is sent a value."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/TimeBatchStrategy"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/timebatchstrategy\/signal(_:)-4r00l"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/TimeBatchStrategy\/signal(_:)-4r00l","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false},{"introduce